    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) in Pakistan, has achieved a new milestone by securing approval as an official examination site for the MRCP(UK) Part 2 Clinical Examination (PACES). This prestigious assessment, conducted on behalf of the three Royal Colleges of Physicians in the UK, evaluates clinical skills essential for physicians worldwide.",
